      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Entombing Grasp",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "earth",
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements A foe within Stone Ghost's reach is standing on stone or soil\n\n---\n\nEffect Stone Ghost briefly extends his intangibility to a foe and drags or pounds them into the earth. He makes an Athletics check check against the target's Fortitude DC. On a success, the foe is planted waist-deep in the ground and is Immobilized and Off-Guard until it Escapes. On a critical success, the foe is completely buried and must hold its breath until it is free or else start suffocating. A successful Escape returns the foe to its original square on the surface, or the closest unoccupied square."
